<div class="container">

<header>
  <h1>Student Performance Analytics Report</h1>
  <p>Factors Influencing Academic Outcomes in Bangladesh</p>
  <div class="meta">Dataset: 1,000 students | 8 districts | 2 school types | Generated: April 2026</div>
</header>

<div class="toc">
  <h2>Table of Contents</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#kpis">Executive KPI Summary</a></li>
