    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card success">
      <div class="kpi-label">Excellent Performance Rate</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">{kpi_data['excellent_rate']:.1f}%</div>
      <div class="kpi-desc">Students achieving HSC GPA ≥ 4.5. One in four students reaches top-tier academic achievement.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card success">
      <div class="kpi-label">At-Risk Student Rate</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">{kpi_data['at_risk_rate']:.1f}%</div>
      <div class="kpi-desc">Students with HSC GPA &lt; 3.0. No students fall below this threshold; however, 24.3% score below 3.5.</div>
    </div>
    <div class="kpi-card warning">
      <div class="kpi-label">GPA Progression Delta</div>
      <div class="kpi-value">+{kpi_data['gpa_delta']:.3f}</div>
      <div class="kpi-desc">Average HSC − Previous GPA. Marginal net improvement masks a 62.6% SSC-to-HSC decline rate.</div>
    </div>
